    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primage \u2013 a unique blend of survival, RPG, and strategic management</strong></h2>Explore a procedurally generated world set in the Stone Age. Develop your settlement, craft tools, fight for survival, and shape your character in a world full of challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game World</strong></h2>\u2013 Infinite, procedurally generated terrain with diverse biomes: forests, swamps, deserts, mountains, caves, and water areas  <br>\u2013 Dynamic day and night cycle  <br>\u2013 Changing weather: rain, storms, fog  <br>\u2013 Four seasons affecting conditions and resource availability<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Elements</strong></h2>\u2013 Hunger and exhaustion affecting regeneration speed and action efficiency  <br>\u2013 Acquiring food through hunting, gathering, and farming  <br>\u2013 Crafting tools and weapons from basic materials<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and Hunting</strong></h2>\u2013 Over 20 animal species: land, aquatic, flying, and venomous  <br>\u2013 10 types of weapons and tools  <br>\u2013 Tracking, skinning, and realistic animal behaviors  <br>\u2013 Combat based on dodging, heavy attacks, and throwing<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Development</strong></h2>\u2013 Point-based ability unlocking system  <br>\u2013 Skills affecting survival, combat, gathering, and tracking  <br>\u2013 Active and passive abilities triggered by context<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Settlement Management</strong></h2>\u2013 Over 30 types of structures: shelters, workstations, storage buildings, furniture  <br>\u2013 Settlers perform tasks: gathering, building, defending, hunting  <br>\u2013 Satisfaction system influencing population growth  <br>\u2013 Reputation and relations with other settlements  <br>\u2013 Task automation through gathering and construction zones<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access is just the beginning</strong></h2>Primage is a long-term project developed in stages. The release version offers a solid foundation, and upcoming updates will introduce new systems, content, and improvements.<br><br>Thank you for your interest and for helping shape the future of the game.<br>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primage \u2013 a unique blend of survival, RPG, and strategic management</strong></h2>Explore a procedurally generated world set in the Stone Age. Develop your settlement, craft tools, fight for survival, and shape your character in a world full of challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game World</strong></h2>\u2013 Infinite, procedurally generated terrain with diverse biomes: forests, swamps, deserts, mountains, caves, and water areas  <br>\u2013 Dynamic day and night cycle  <br>\u2013 Changing weather: rain, storms, fog  <br>\u2013 Four seasons affecting conditions and resource availability<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Elements</strong></h2>\u2013 Hunger and exhaustion affecting regeneration speed and action efficiency  <br>\u2013 Acquiring food through hunting, gathering, and farming  <br>\u2013 Crafting tools and weapons from basic materials<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and Hunting</strong></h2>\u2013 Over 20 animal species: land, aquatic, flying, and venomous  <br>\u2013 10 types of weapons and tools  <br>\u2013 Tracking, skinning, and realistic animal behaviors  <br>\u2013 Combat based on dodging, heavy attacks, and throwing<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Development</strong></h2>\u2013 Point-based ability unlocking system  <br>\u2013 Skills affecting survival, combat, gathering, and tracking  <br>\u2013 Active and passive abilities triggered by context<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Settlement Management</strong></h2>\u2013 Over 30 types of structures: shelters, workstations, storage buildings, furniture  <br>\u2013 Settlers perform tasks: gathering, building, defending, hunting  <br>\u2013 Satisfaction system influencing population growth  <br>\u2013 Reputation and relations with other settlements  <br>\u2013 Task automation through gathering and construction zones<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access is just the beginning</strong></h2>Primage is a long-term project developed in stages. The release version offers a solid foundation, and upcoming updates will introduce new systems, content, and improvements.<br><br>Thank you for your interest and for helping shape the future of the game.<br>",
    "short_description": "As the leader of a Stone Age tribe, gather resources, develop your settlement and lead your people through the challenges of a world full of danger and mystery. Your survival skills, strategic planning and decision-making will be key in this battle for survival.",
