        ],
        "notes": "Our game, set in the Stone Age, contains mature content that players should be aware of. This includes:\r\n\r\nViolence and Gore: As a survival game, it features hunting and combat with realistic depictions of violence and blood. This includes battles with prehistoric creatures and other human characters, where injuries and deaths are portrayed with a certain degree of realism.\r\n\r\nSurvival Themes: The game includes survival challenges in harsh environments, which may depict situations of peril and life-threatening scenarios.\r\n\r\nSubstance Use: There are references to and depictions of primitive forms of substance use, akin to what might be historically accurate for the setting, but no modern drugs or alcohol are featured.\r\n\r\nThe game does not contain sexual content, sexual assault/non-consensual sex, or themes of self-harm. Our depiction of substance use is limited to historical context without glorifying drug or alcohol abuse."
    },
